  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IGLHRC, HBT-Strategi f&#xF6;r Afrika, 2012-2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IGLHRC, LGBT Strategy for Africa, 2012-2014 - IGLHRC&#xB4;s LGBT Strategy for Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xF6;vergripande m&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att bygga starkare hbt- r&#xF6;relser i Afrika   baserat p&#xE5; m&#xE5;l och riktlinjer av lokala, nationella och regionala     ledare. IGLHRC implementerar inom 3 programomr&#xE5;den 1)                 kapacitetsuppbyggnad inom dokumentation av brott mot m&#xE4;nskliga        r&#xE4;ttigheter, 2) P&#xE5;verkansarbete 3) Sub-granting. Synligg&#xF6;ra lesbiska  och transpersoner och empowerment &#xE4;r integrerade tematiska omr&#xE5;den.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall aim is to build stronger LGBT rights movements in Africa  based on the visions and directions of local, national, and regional  leaders. IGLHRC implements in 3 program areas 1) Human Rights         Documentation Capacity Building, 2) Global Advocacy, 3) Sub-granting  and Emergency Response. Decriminalization and lesbian and transgender visibility and empowerm are cross-cutting thematic themes.</narrative>
  </description>
